graph LR
    Module["MCP Lifecycle<br/>Module Operator"]

    %% Internal platform
    Platform["opendatahub-operator /<br/>rhods-operator"] -->|creates CR, env, ConfigMap<br/>reads status.distribution| Module
    Module -->|deploys / upgrades / GCs| Operand["mcp-lifecycle-operator<br/>(operand)"]
    Module -->|Go library: deployer,<br/>conditions, TLS framework| Utils["odh-platform-utilities"]
    Module -->|TLS profile watch| OCPAPI["OpenShift APIServer config"]

    %% Required external libs
    Module -->|framework| CR["controller-runtime v0.25.2"]
    Module -->|clients| ClientGo["client-go v0.37.2"]
    Module -->|manifest transforms| Manifestival["manifestival v0.7.2"]
    Module -->|listener types| GWAPILib["gateway-api v1.6.3"]
    Module -->|TLS types / curves| OCPLibs["openshift/api,<br/>library-go"]

    %% Cluster add-ons
    Operand -->|webhook + metrics TLS<br/>required| CertManager["cert-manager"]
    Module -.->|ServiceMonitor optional| PromOp["Prometheus Operator"]
    Module -.->|MCPGatewayExtension discovery<br/>optional| Kuadrant["Kuadrant MCP Gateway"]
    Module -.->|Gateway listener discovery<br/>optional| GWCRDs["Gateway API CRDs"]
    Module -.->|StorageVersionMigration<br/>optional| SVM["kube-storage-version-migrator"]

    Module -->|HTTPS/6443| K8sAPI["Kubernetes API"]

